{"id":849,"slug":"smiles-of-a-summer-night","title":"Smiles of a Summer Night","year":1955,"country":"Sweden","duration":109,"spine":237,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/849-smiles-of-a-summer-night","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/49d4e46716d93aa132026d0e65f01e8c/JeSHBn1n1YRTcQFQUUfPktyUtEzqrT_large.jpg","description":"\nAfter fifteen films that received mostly local acclaim, the comedy Smiles of a Summer Night at last ushered in an international audience for Ingmar Bergman. In turn-of-the-century Sweden, four men and four women attempt to navigate the laws of attraction. During a weekend in the country, the women collude to force the men’s hands in matters of the heart, exposing their pretensions and insecurities along the way. Chock-full of flirtatious propositions and sharp witticisms delivered by such Swedish screen legends as Gunnar Björnstrand and Harriet Andersson, Smiles of a Summer Night is one of cinema’s great erotic comedies.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Ingmar Bergman","slug":"ingmar-bergman"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Ulla Jacobsson","role":"Anne Egerman","slug":"ulla-jacobsson"},{"actor":"Eva Dahlbeck","role":"Desirée Armfeldt","slug":"eva-dahlbeck"},{"actor":"Harriet Andersson","role":"Petra, the maid","slug":"harriet-andersson"},{"actor":"Margit Carlqvist","role":"Charlotte Malcolm","slug":"margit-carlqvist"},{"actor":"Gunnar Björnstrand","role":"Fredrik Egerman","slug":"gunnar-bjornstrand"},{"actor":"Jarl Kulle","role":"Carl-Magnus Malcolm","slug":"jarl-kulle"},{"actor":"Åke Fridell","role":"Frid, the groom","slug":"ake-fridell-2"},{"actor":"Björn Bjelfvenstam","role":"Henrik Egerman","slug":"bjorn-bjelfvenstam"},{"actor":"Naima Wifstrand","role":"Mrs. Armfeldt","slug":"naima-wifstrand"},{"actor":"Jullan Kindahl","role":"Beata, the cook","slug":"jullan-kindahl"},{"actor":"Gull Natorp","role":"Malla","slug":"gull-natorp"},{"actor":"Bibi Andersson","role":"Actresses in play","slug":"bibi-andersson"},{"act